{"slug":"bjizzle-unleashes-new-video-lottery-ticket","postId":74424,"title":"BJizzle Unleashes New Video 'Lottery Ticket'","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514750,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img class=\"wp-image-514750\" src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/273054624_1019471005661044_2470602484319769651_n-824x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\n<figcaption>Courtesy of BJizzle</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>BJizzle Unleashes New Video 'Lottery Ticket'. Harlem, New York's own BJizzle, is back as he unleashes his latest single 'Lottery Ticket (Free Mind Freestyle).'</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lottery Ticket is a vibe that reminds me of Nipsey Hussle's part on Dedication featuring Kendrick Lamar off the Nipsey's project Victory Lab.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CZkBovVA-x2/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">https://www.instagram.com/tv/CZkBovVA-x2/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link</div>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lottery Ticket is the follow-up single to Thuggin, which features Richie Rozay that BJizzle released <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/01/27/harlem-artist-bjizzles-music-is-a-vibe-check-new-single-thuggin/\">earlier this month</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After listening to and watching the video to Lottery Ticket, I can't wait to see what BJizzle has in store next. Lottery Ticket can be viewed below, and make sure you keep up with BJizzle on Instagram for the latest updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6FnO02Q-aik\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6FnO02Q-aik</div>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Courtesy of BJizzle BJizzle Unleashes New Video 'Lottery Ticket'. Harlem, New York's own BJizzle, is back as he unleashes his latest single 'Lottery Ticket (Free Mind Freestyle).' Lottery Ticket is…","publishedAt":"2022-02-05T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-02-05T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"music","name":"Music"},{"slug":"news","name":"News"}],"tags":[{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"lottery-ticket","name":"Lottery Ticket"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/273054624_1019471005661044_2470602484319769651_n-824x1024.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/273054624_1019471005661044_2470602484319769651_n-824x1024.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/bjizzle-unleashes-new-video-lottery-ticket/"}